name: burglary_series
description: "Burglary series - incidents linked to the people who sold an item with a stolen serial, the dealers they sold to, their households and the plates those households keep (police_property_links_dataset). One community holds 13 Leeds North and Leeds East burglaries of Feb-Apr 2026 matched to three sellers at DLR-04 and DLR-09, and the plate ZX 9117 X, kept by a seller's partner at the same address, seen near 11 of the 18 scenes; together all 18 join. The other matches are one-off sellers. A taxi seen near 54 other scenes is not in this view."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: police_property_links_dataset
    sourceCol: src
    targetCol: dst
    linkKindCol: kind
    attrCols[3]: ts,amount,via
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
